%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
[1 2 3 4 5 6] [6 5 4 3 2 1] 6 array concatmatrix aload pop 6 { r } repeat
[1 2] [3 4] 6 array concatmatrix
1 2 3 concatmatrix
[2 0 0 2 0 0] concat 1 1 transform p
[1 2] concat
5 concat
3 4 matrix scale aload pop 6 { r } repeat
3 4 matrix translate aload pop 6 { r } repeat
45 matrix rotate aload pop 6 { r } repeat
(a) scale
(a) 1 scale
(a) translate
(a) rotate
(a) matrix rotate
1 (a) matrix scale
